              "bbox": [
                0.324,
                0.231,
                0.653,
                0.359
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_20_image_4.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.37,
            0.835,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "It contains 30 units of 1° angle and so we say that its angle measure is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Measures of different angles:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " What is the measure of a full turn in degrees? As we have taken it to contain 360 degrees, its measure is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.452,
            0.835,
            0.568
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What is the measure of a straight angle in degrees? A straight angle is half of a full turn. As a full-turn is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 6 0 ^ { \\circ } ]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , a half turn is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 8 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " What is the measure of a right angle in degrees? Two right angles together form a straight angle. As a straight angle measures "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 8 0 ^ { \\circ } ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , a right angle measures 90°."
            }
          ]
        },
